cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use DrugTargetBench, please cite it as below.
title: "DrugTargetBench: A contamination-resistant, agentic benchmark for autonomous therapeutic target discovery"
abstract: >-
  DrugTargetBench evaluates whether an AI agent can run an end-to-end
  therapeutic target discovery program on a synthetic population with
  genotypes, multi-omics, raw cine-MRI, EHR records and survival outcomes,
  with no phenotype column and no answer key. Twenty procedurally generated
  worlds carry ten planted trap mechanisms and a budgeted virtual knockdown
  oracle that re-runs the underlying structural causal model.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sammargolis/DrugTargetBench"
url: "https://drugtargetbench.vercel.app"
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - agentic AI
  - causal inference
  - Mendelian randomization
  - target discovery
  - cardiovascular
authors:
  - name: The DrugTargetBench Authors
version: "0.9"
